[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":96},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":28,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_43":44,"_45":-5,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":37,"_55":37,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":61},"expiresAt",1795135240000,"id","npae2p2bauihkhq9p8huoutnf","title","OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","originalTitle","OpenJDK Java4Shell Base64解码远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2026-114938）","summary","OpenJDK Java4Shell Base64解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可经网络输入在无需认证的条件下劫持执行流。受影响范围包括 OpenJDK 17、21、25、27及对应 GraalVM，部分 Keycloak、Jira、Confluence 等产品存在未授权 RCE。","reason","文章给出利用链、受影响产品、版本区间与临时缓解参数，便于团队快速核对暴露资产并安排升级。","source",{"_73":95},"links",{"_83":94},"publishedAt","2026-11-18T01:41:00.000Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-18T15:36:33.764Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[86,87,88,89,90,91,92,93],"score",90,"selected",true,"channel","news","story",{"_79":80,"_13":81},"x","readingMode","full","author","body",{"_61":82,"_83":-5,"_84":83,"_85":37},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[78],"topics",[68,69,70],"indexable","markdownAvailable","group",{"_62":63,"_64":65,"_66":67},"hasTranslation",false,"bodyLanguage","zh","factId","fd55XLZ5t838","reportCount",6,"additionalSourceCount",5,{"_71":76,"_73":77},{"_71":31,"_73":75},{"_71":72,"_73":74},"slug","research","name","技术研究","漏洞披露","oracle","Oracle / 甲骨文",{"_79":80,"_13":81},"publicId","8540cb70-bd3c-4700-8134-83f02bb49280","Java4Shell已出现利用尝试，Red Hat补丁待发","<p><span>阿里云应急响应</span> <span>2026-11-18 09:41</span> <span>浙江</span></p><p><img src=\"/dailyinfo/media/d76b76994e46d620.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>2026年11月18日，阿里云安全监测到 CVE-2026-114938 OpenJDK Java4Shell Base64解码远程代码执行漏洞</p><p><span><span><span>2026年11月18日，阿里云安全监测到&nbsp;</span><span>CVE-2026-114938 OpenJDK Java4Shell Base64解码远程代码执行漏洞。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>01</span></span></p><p><span><span>风险描述</span></span></p><p><span><span>OpenJDK 是 Java SE 的开源实现。2026年11月18日，官方披露 CVE-2026-114938 OpenJDK Java4Shell Base64解码远程代码执行漏洞。C2 JIT 编译器将 Base64 解码热路径编译为使用 AVX-512 VBMI 指令的手写汇编，该汇编在处理带 = 填充的短输入块时输出长度掩码计算下溢，对结果数组产生越界写入。攻击者可据此在目标 JVM 内先获得固定值越界写与堆内信息泄露，再经堆布局整形升级为任意写、劫持执行流，最终在无需任何认证的情况下通过网络输入达成远程代码执行。 经研究目前已确认以下产品受直接影响：</span></span></p><p><span><span>&nbsp;1、未授权（pre-auth）RCE：Keycloak、Atlassian Jira / Confluence、JFrog Artifactory、Jenkins、PingFederate&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、认证后（post-auth）RCE：Kafka、Solr、Elasticsearch、Gerrit、Spinnaker</span></span></p><p><span><span>02</span></span></p><p><span><span>风险评级</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>CVE-2026-114938</span></span></span><span><br></span></span></span><span><span><span>OpenJDK Java4Shell Base64解码远程代码执行漏洞 严重</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>03</span></span></p><p><span><span>影响范围</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>Oracle Corporation / Oracle Java SE&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 8 企业性能变体： = 8u511b33-perf（点版本，仅 perf 变体；JDK 8 标准线不受此漏洞影响）&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 17： &gt;= 17.0.6 且 &lt;= 17.0.21.0.3（17.0.6 引入受影响 intrinsic，17.0.5 及更早安全）&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 21： &gt;= 21 且 &lt;= 21.0.13.0.3&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 25： &gt;= 25 且 &lt;= 25.0.5.0.3&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 27： &gt;= 27 且 &lt;= 27.0.1.0.3&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>Oracle Corporation / Oracle GraalVM for JDK</span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 17： &gt;= 17.0.6 且 &lt;= 17.0.21.0.3&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 21： &gt;= 21 且 &lt;= 21.0.13.0.3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>Oracle Corporation / Oracle GraalVM Enterprise Edition&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ GraalVM EE 21.3 线： = 21.3.20.0.3（受支持版本；更早 EOL 版本以 Oracle 清单为准）&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>OpenJDK 及全部 OpenJDK 系发行版（Eclipse Temurin、Amazon Corretto、Microsoft Build of OpenJDK、 Azul Zulu、BellSoft Liberica、SAP SapMachine、Red Hat OpenJDK；仅 x86-64 + AVX-512 VBMI 硬件， ARM64 平台不受影响）</span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 17： &gt;= 17.0.6 且 &lt;= 17.0.21.0.3&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 21： &gt;= 21 且 &lt;= 21.0.13.0.3&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 25： &gt;= 25 且 &lt;= 25.0.5.0.3&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 27： &gt;= 27 且 &lt;= 27.0.1.0.3&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>04</span></span></p><p><span><span>安全版本</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>&nbsp;∘ JDK 8 / JDK 11 标准线： 不受此漏洞影响（不含该 intrinsic）&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 17： &gt;= 17.0.21.1（安全）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>&nbsp;∘ JDK 21： &gt;= 21.0.13.1（安全）&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 25： &gt;= 25.0.5.1（安全）&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ JDK 27： &gt;= 27.0.1.1（安全）&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ GraalVM for JDK 17/21： &gt;= 17.0.21.1 / &gt;= 21.0.13.1（同源修复）&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>∘ 下游发行版： &gt;= 各家对应 .1 版本（Temurin 等截至发文尚未跟发，以各发行版公告为准）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>05</span></span></p><p><span><span>修复方案</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1、Oracle官方已经发布安全更新，<a href=\"https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cspunov2026.html\">https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cspunov2026.html</a>&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2、下游发行版（Temurin / Corretto / Zulu 等）会持续发布对应安全版本，以各发行版公告的版本号为准&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3、临时缓解：利用-XX:-UseBASE64Intrinsics 精确关闭 Base64 intrinsic，或者使用 -XX:UseAVX=2 禁用 AVX-512（ARM不支持）&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4、阿里云云安全中心资产暴露分析功能可对应筛选相关JDK版本支持进行初步影响面排查分析</span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://avd.aliyun.com/detail?id=AVD-2026-114938\">阅读原文</a></p><p><a href=\"https://wechat2rss.xlab.app/link-proxy/?k=cce75024&amp;r=1&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%3F__biz%3DMzI5MzY2MzM0Mw%3D%3D%26mid%3D2247486425%26idx%3D1%26sn%3Da79b346d585971698fe43b28fba843aa\">跳转微信打开</a></p>","original","zhKind","complete","漏洞","漏洞分析","补丁","Oracle","Red Hat","Microsoft","Atlassian","AWS","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI5MzY2MzM0Mw==&mid=2247486425&idx=1&sn=a79b346d585971698fe43b28fba843aa","阿里云应急响应",{"_97":98,"_99":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
